    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/774fd56489a4734790ac490d8aa48821.avif?t=1753381766\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the dead turn into zombies, your job is to manage your very own Graveyard! Perform burials and cremations, fulfill visitor requests, manage facilities, and keep your staff and defenses in top shape. But when night falls, everything changes. The dead may rest, but the zombies don\u2019t. They are coming for your precious work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/ff2dda5d824b6ce2d747f07f2c45a3bd.poster.avif?t=1753381766\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/ff2dda5d824b6ce2d747f07f2c45a3bd.webm?t=1753381766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/ff2dda5d824b6ce2d747f07f2c45a3bd.mp4?t=1753381766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visitor Satisfaction is Key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After processing the bodies, visitors will return to check on their loved ones. Your duty is to keep graves intact while providing fresh flowers and maintaining a welcoming environment. Every visit rewards you with valuable bonuses to help your business thrive. <br><br>Visitors can also stop by the <strong>Chapel</strong> to rest and browse the <strong>Souvenir Shop</strong> for small keepsakes like candles and incenses. A clean and decorated graveyard encourages greater generosity while donating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/cf622c08d7e788bade1406eeeb44018b.poster.avif?t=1753381766\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/cf622c08d7e788bade1406eeeb44018b.webm?t=1753381766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/cf622c08d7e788bade1406eeeb44018b.mp4?t=1753381766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your Defenses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, waves of zombies will come with their numbers growing and special zombie types emerging, hungry for freshly buried bodies and for you. From basic defenses like barbed wires and fences to advanced machines like automatic turrets, keep your defenses upgraded, repaired, and fully stocked with ammo to withstand the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/5edcc1026c1bd8af52e9e95e93e04a9d.poster.avif?t=1753381766\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/5edcc1026c1bd8af52e9e95e93e04a9d.webm?t=1753381766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/5edcc1026c1bd8af52e9e95e93e04a9d.mp4?t=1753381766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trust your Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of weapons, including pistols, rifles, shotguns, and your trusty shovel, you are the ultimate force against the Zombies. As you level up, unlock and purchase new weapons to become even stronger. Just make sure to stock up on enough ammo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/acb1b0e3e6d11e5e39f1021e391a4ce8.poster.avif?t=1753381766\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/acb1b0e3e6d11e5e39f1021e391a4ce8.webm?t=1753381766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/acb1b0e3e6d11e5e39f1021e391a4ce8.mp4?t=1753381766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Even a Graveyard Can Be Cozy Sometimes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Farming Area to grow different flowers for profit and vegetables to simply eat and restore your energy and health. With Upgrades, you can even unlock a Grinder to turn zombie parts into Fertilizer. Decorate your Graveyard with benches, lights, and other ornaments to make it truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/a66dafaea79ff26df0069b52055cf308.poster.avif?t=1753381766\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/a66dafaea79ff26df0069b52055cf308.webm?t=1753381766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/a66dafaea79ff26df0069b52055cf308.mp4?t=1753381766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand and Upgrade Your Facilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your graveyard isn\u2019t just a resting place, it's a business, and every upgrade matters. Expand your <strong>burial areas</strong> and upgrade your <strong>crematorium</strong> with more furnaces and automated systems. Improve your <strong>water supply</strong>, manage <strong>resource production</strong>, and decorate your grounds to stay ahead of growing demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire a team of employees to help with day-to-day tasks: the <strong>Florist</strong> keeps flowers running, the <strong>Gravekeeper</strong> maintains burials and cremations, the <strong>Gardener</strong> keeps your farm in check, and the <strong>Technician</strong> ensures all machines run smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every improvement helps you stay one step ahead of both business demands and the undead threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and expand your own graveyard while balancing business and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and maintain defenses against nightly zombie attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform burials, cremations, and keep visitors satisfied with flowers and souvenirs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a Chapel with a donation system and a fully stocked Souvenir Shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff like Florists, Gravekeepers, Gardeners, and Technicians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade facilities including the crematorium, farming area, and water systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons and enhance your combat skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your graveyard with decorations and functional upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a mix of management, strategy, and first-person action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the dead turn into zombies, your job is to manage your very own Graveyard! Perform burials and cremations, fulfill visitor requests, manage facilities, and keep your staff and defenses in top shape. But when night falls, everything changes. The dead may rest, but the zombies don\u2019t. They are coming for your precious work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/ff2dda5d824b6ce2d747f07f2c45a3bd.poster.avif?t=1753381766\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/ff2dda5d824b6ce2d747f07f2c45a3bd.webm?t=1753381766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/ff2dda5d824b6ce2d747f07f2c45a3bd.mp4?t=1753381766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visitor Satisfaction is Key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After processing the bodies, visitors will return to check on their loved ones. Your duty is to keep graves intact while providing fresh flowers and maintaining a welcoming environment. Every visit rewards you with valuable bonuses to help your business thrive. <br><br>Visitors can also stop by the <strong>Chapel</strong> to rest and browse the <strong>Souvenir Shop</strong> for small keepsakes like candles and incenses. A clean and decorated graveyard encourages greater generosity while donating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430450/extras/cf622c08d7e788bade1406eeeb44018b.poster.avif?t=1753381766\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https: