ragraph\" >Hire a team of employees to help with day-to-day tasks: the <strong>Florist</strong> keeps flowers running, the <strong>Gravekeeper</strong> maintains burials and cremations, the <strong>Gardener</strong> keeps your farm in check, and the <strong>Technician</strong> ensures all machines run smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every improvement helps you stay one step ahead of both business demands and the undead threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and expand your own graveyard while balancing business and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and maintain defenses against nightly zombie attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform burials, cremations, and keep visitors satisfied with flowers and souvenirs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a Chapel with a donation system and a fully stocked Souvenir Shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff like Florists, Gravekeepers, Gardeners, and Technicians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade facilities including the crematorium, farming area, and water systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons and enhance your combat skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your graveyard with decorations and functional upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a mix of management, strategy, and first-person action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
